<title>SWEDEN: SWEDISH SANDBLOM BUYS STAKE IN ULO SAKALA.</title>
<headline>SWEDISH SANDBLOM BUYS STAKE IN ULO SAKALA.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Sandblom and Stohnes said on Tuesday its subsidiary Eltekniks has bought a 20 percent stake in Estonia's Ulo Sakala via its daughter firm Stohne Elteknik with the option of becoming a majority shareholder.</p>
<p>Sakala sells electrical components to industry and to electrical equipment installors in Estonia. Its turnover was thre million Swedish crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +468 700 1005</p>
